OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADrunk and dangerous e-bike riders
OL,4,Aface on-the-spot fines under crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople riding drunk or dangerously on
OL,7,Fe-bikes ` and those who jump red lights
OL,8,F- could face on-the-spot fines under
OL,9,Fplans to curb anti-social behaviour.
OL,11,FFirms which run shared e-bike schemes
OL,12,Fwill also be expected to manage their
OL,13,Ffleets better and provide designated
OL,14,Fparking areas to keep pavements safe.
OL,16,FThey could also be required to take out
OL,17,Finsurance so people can claim
OL,18,Fcompensation if they are hit by someone
OL,19,Fon a shared bike.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
